# Two tasks selected before another program adds a project to the file are still selected after the reload, so x completes both.
file <<END
Work:
	- Write report
	- Review PRs
	- Plan sprint
END
keys j J
outside <<END
Work:
	- Write report
	- Review PRs
	- Plan sprint
Home:
END
see Home:
keys x
quit
saved <<END
Work:
	- Write report @done({today})
	- Review PRs @done({today})
	- Plan sprint
Home:
END
